                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The only RTS where Kennedy and Khrushchev both said \"f*** it\" and pressed the big red button, forcing you to fight World War III in a radioactive parking lot with three tanks and a wooden fence. You spend 45 minutes carefully planning a tactical flank, only to realize the entire map is glowing green, your squad has radiation poisoning, and your main battle tank just got deleted by a Soviet guy throwing a grenade from 200 yards away. It's peak 2005 strategy gaming: you click on a truck, it pathfinds into a crater, explodes instantly, and the game autosaves while your remaining infantry dies of tetanus. 10/10 nuclear tactical logistics simulator.",
